### 6b. Configure Grading Scheme
# Assumes Section ID 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/professor/grading/configure/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{prof_token}}

[
  {
    "name": "Midterm Exam",
    "weight_percent": 40,
    "children": [
      { "name": "Multiple Choice", "max_score": 50 },
      { "name": "Essay", "max_score": 50 }
    ]
  },
  {
    "name": "Final Project",
    "weight_percent": 60,
    "children": [
      { "name": "Documentation", "max_score": 40 },
      { "name": "Implementation", "max_score": 60 }
    ]
  }
]

### 6c. Get Grade Sheet (View)
# Check response for Component IDs (e.g., 2, 3, 5, 6)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/professor/grading/sheet/1
Authorization: Bearer {{prof_token}}

### 6d. Submit Grades
# Using Enrollment ID 1 (Joshu)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/professor/grading/submit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{prof_token}}

[
  { "enrollment_id": 1, "component_id": 2, "score": 45 },
  { "enrollment_id": 1, "component_id": 3, "score": 48 }
]

### 6e. Verify Grades (View again)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/professor/grading/sheet/1
Authorization: Bearer {{prof_token}}

### 4e. List Pending Enrollments (Verify API exists)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/enrollments/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 4d. APPROVE Enrollment (Admin Action)
# Ensure the ID '2' matches the enrollment created in step 4c
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/approve/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 5e. REJECT Enrollment (Admin Action)
# Ensure the ID '3' matches the enrollment created in step 5d
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reject/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
  "reason": "Conflicts with prerequisites. Please advise with your chairperson."
}